  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A system of moment of inertia <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"I\"></span> rotates from rest about a given axis. The angular acceleration α of the system is constant.</p>\n<p>What is the change in angular momentum when the system has made four complete rotations about the given axis?<br/><br/></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2I\\sqrt{2\\pi\\alpha}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4I\\sqrt{\\pi\\alpha}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2I\\sqrt{2\\alpha}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4I\\sqrt{\\alpha}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
